@#KARADOC

       `$í `0At The Statue of Karadoc `$í `2
       
             Ah... Noble Mage Karadoc Meister who became
           a God. Felicity married him because she was lonely
           and her ex-husband who was dead told her to.
           (`5Damn talking statues`2) So, thus began her life
           with Noble Mage Karadoc Meister, until she decided,
           "Hell, he can't help me at all. He's always in 
           heaven! I need an earth man." So she divorced Karadoc,
           and Karadoc as angry as he was turned himself into this
           statue as a reminder of himself.

           (`5P`2) Pray to the Noble Mage Karadoc Meister.
           (`5L`2) Leave this no Good husband.

